flowchart TD
  SOURCE[Bound source configuration and compiler] --> GEN[Selected campaign generation]
  GEN --> PASS[Pass traces and native objects]
  GEN --> BOOT[Native stage objects executions and dependencies]
  GEN --> CENSUS[Private source inventory and exclusions]
  PASS --> PR[Read pass boundaries effects and results]
  BOOT --> BR[Read source seed stage identity and all executions]
  CENSUS --> CR[Reconstruct private inventory and counts]
  SOURCE --> PR
  SOURCE --> BR
  SOURCE --> CR
  PR --> GATE[Computed gate outcomes]
  BR --> GATE
  CR --> GATE
  GATE --> FULL{Every required reader connected and passed}
  FULL -->|yes| ACCEPT[Complete acceptance]
  FULL -->|no| OPEN[Incomplete manifest and nonzero outcome]
